NoovexOS Intel Wi-Fi 6/6E driver (drivers/net/wifi/iwx)

iwx.h, iwx_pcie.c, iwx_fw.c, iwx_cmd.h, iwx_cmd.c, iwx_scan.c, iwx_data.c, iwx_glue.c
(and iwx_pnvm.c when added)
  Port of OpenBSD sys/dev/pci/if_iwx.c (rev 1.230) and if_iwxreg.h (rev 1.75).
